<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Unit 13 Workbook Page 103</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #000;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Header styling */
        .header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .header-dots {
            flex-grow: 1;
            border-bottom: 3px dotted #000;
            margin: 0 10px;
            height: 10px;
        }
        .header-title {
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .header-unit {
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        /* Question Layout */
        .question-block {
            display: flex;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .q-number-wrapper {
            width: 40px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            padding-top: 2px;
        }
        .q-number {
            background-color: #a4d65e;
            color: #000;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 26px;
            height: 26px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .q-content {
            flex-grow: 1;
        }
        .instruction {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        /* 2c Styles */
        .phrase-box {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            width: 90%;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        .pink-box {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #faeae5, #fcf3ee, #fae9e3);
            border: 1px solid #ecc9be;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .pink-box ol {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        .pink-box li {
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .handwritten-fill {
            font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive, sans-serif;
            color: #666;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #888;
            padding: 0 10px;
            margin: 0 2px;
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        /* 2d Styles */
        .dashed-box {
            border: 2px dashed #a4d65e;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            margin-top: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .word-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
            text-align: center;
        }
        .col {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .hw-word {
            font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive, sans-serif;
            color: #777;
            font-size: 13px;
            min-height: 20px;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }
        .print-word {
            font-weight: normal;
            font-size: 15px;
            margin: 2px 0;
            color: #000;
        }

        /* Notes Section (between 2e and 3a) */
        .notes-section {
            font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive, sans-serif;
            color: #8b5a2b;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-left: 150px;
            margin-top: -10px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .note-flex-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: stretch;
        }
        .big-brace {
            font-size: 50px;
            font-weight: 100;
            line-height: 0.8;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 0 2px;
        }
        .small-brace {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 100;
            line-height: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 0 2px;
        }
        .dashed-divider {
            border-top: 2px dashed #000;
            margin: 5px 0 15px 0;
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* 3a Styles */
        .chart-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        .chart-table th, .chart-table td {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            width: 25%;
        }
        .chart-table th {
            background-color: #e6f2ff;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .chart-table td {
            height: 60px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            text-align: right;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .page-num {
            background-color: #a4d65e;
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <span style="letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 10px;">•••••••••••••</span>
            <span class="header-title" style="margin-left: 5px;">We're trying to save the earth!</span>
            <span class="header-dots"></span>
            <span class="header-unit">UNIT 13</span>
            <span style="letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 10px; margin-left: 10px;">••••••••••••••</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 2c -->
        <div class="question-block">
            <div class="q-number-wrapper">
                <div class="q-number">2c</div>
            </div>
            <div class="q-content">
                <div class="instruction">Fill in the blanks with the correct forms of the phrases in the box.</div>

                <div class="phrase-box">
                    <div>put to good use<br>set up</div>
                    <div>build ... out of<br>known for</div>
                    <div>pull down<br>not only ... but also</div>
                </div>

                <div class="pink-box">
                    <ol>
                        <li>Amy Hayes lives in the UK. Many of the old buildings in her neighborhood were <span class="handwritten-fill">pulled down</span> .</li>
                        <li>All the rubbish and old things in Amy's neighborhood were then <span class="handwritten-fill">put to good use</span> when Amy built her house.</li>
                        <li>Amy is very creative. She <span class="handwritten-fill">built</span> her front gate <span class="handwritten-fill">out of</span> rocks and old glass bottles. She put an old boat on top of her house.</li>
                        <li>Jessica Wong sells her bags in a small shop, but she has also <span class="handwritten-fill">set up</span> an online business to sell them.</li>
                        <li>Though Jessica's bags are made from old clothes, her bags are <span class="handwritten-fill">known for</span> being cute and useful.</li>
                        <li>Wang Tao <span class="handwritten-fill">not only</span> makes large pieces of metal art that look like animals or humans, <span class="handwritten-fill">but also</span> makes smaller pieces for the home.</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 2d -->
        <div class="question-block">
            <div class="q-number-wrapper">
                <div class="q-number">2d</div>
            </div>
            <div class="q-content">
                <div class="instruction"><u>Underline</u> the words in the passage based on the words below. What are the differences?</div>

                <div class="dashed-box">
                    <div class="word-grid">
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="hw-word">rethink</div>
                            <div class="print-word">think</div>
                            <div class="print-word">special</div>
                            <div class="hw-word">especially</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="hw-word" style="line-height: 0.9; margin-top: -5px;">useful/<br>reuse</div>
                            <div class="print-word">use</div>
                            <div class="print-word">recent</div>
                            <div class="hw-word">recently</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="hw-word">unusual</div>
                            <div class="print-word">usual</div>
                            <div class="print-word">environment</div>
                            <div class="hw-word">environmental</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="hw-word">recycling</div>
                            <div class="print-word">recycle</div>
                            <div class="print-word">important</div>
                            <div class="hw-word">importance</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="hw-word">building</div>
                            <div class="print-word">build</div>
                            <div class="print-word">protect</div>
                            <div class="hw-word">protection</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="hw-word" style="margin-left: -15px;">creation/creativity</div>
                            <div class="print-word">create</div>
                            <div class="print-word">inspire</div>
                            <div class="hw-word">inspiration</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 2e -->
        <div class="question-block" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">
            <div class="q-number-wrapper">
                <div class="q-number">2e</div>
            </div>
            <div class="q-content">
                <div class="instruction">
                    Make a list of things that need to be done to save the environment.<br>
                    Which things can be done by common people every day? Which things<br>
                    have to be done by governments and organizations? Discuss these with<br>
                    your group.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Handwritten Notes Section -->
        <div class="notes-section">
            <div class="note-flex-container">
                <div style="padding-top: 15px;">need</div>
                <div class="big-brace">{</div>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;">
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: stretch;">
                        <div style="padding-top: 5px;">实义v.</div>
                        <div class="small-brace">{</div>
                        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
                            <div>need to do sth. 需要做某事</div>
                            <div>need doing/to be done (某事)需要被做</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div style="margin-top: 2px;">[情态v. + 动词原形]</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Simulating the curved line pointing down to 'need' -->
            <div style="position: absolute; left: 18px; top: 35px; width: 2px; height: 50px; background-color: #8b5a2b; border-radius: 50% 0 0 50%; transform: rotate(5deg);"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="dashed-divider"></div>

        <!-- Section 3a -->
        <div class="question-block" style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <div class="q-number-wrapper">
                <div class="q-number">3a</div>
            </div>
            <div class="q-content">
                <div class="instruction">
                    Think about the environment in your town/city and complete the chart<br>below.
                </div>
                <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                    Which parts of the town/city have a nice environment? Why are they nice?<br>
                    Which parts <span style="border-bottom: 2px solid #8b5a2b; padding-bottom: 1px;">need</span> to be improved? Why?
                </div>

                <table class="chart-table">
                    <tr>
                        <th>Good environment</th>
                        <th>Why?</th>
                        <th>Bad environment</th>
                        <th>Why?</th>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                        <td></td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <span class="page-num">103</span>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</html>
